  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The merge uses `validate=\"one_to_one\"` so that each year-week combination appears only once in each table. The descriptive checks and inspection of unusually high weeks are important because a large malaria count should not automatically be deleted as an outlier: it may represent a real high-transmission week.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Lagged predictors and temporal structure\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 40,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
