  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The weather lags were selected using the training period only, avoiding leakage from the future test years. Despite one temperature term appearing statistically significant in the fitted model, the weather-augmented model performed worse out of sample. This is an important lesson: **statistical significance does not guarantee forecasting value**.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 11. Simplified Negative Binomial model\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 91,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "(259, 33)\n",
      "(104, 33)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "features_simple = [\n",
    "    \"cases_lag_1\",\n",
    "    \"sin_week\",\n",
    "    \"cos_week\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "train_simple = train.dropna(\n",
    "    subset=features_simple + [\"cases\"]\n",
    ").copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "test_simple = test.dropna(\n",
    "    subset=features_simple + [\"cases\"]\n",
    ").copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(train_simple.shape)\n",
    "print(test_simple.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 92,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "(256, 33)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "train_simple_common = train.dropna(\n",
    "    subset=[\n",
    "        \"cases_lag_1\",\n",
    "        \"cases_lag_2\",\n",
    "        \"cases_lag_3\",\n",
    "        \"cases_lag_4\",\n",
    "        \"sin_week\",\n",
    "        \"cos_week\",\n",
    "        \"cases\"\n",
    "    ]\n",
    ").copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(train_simple_common.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 93,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n",
    "\n",
    "scaler_simple = StandardScaler()\n",
    "\n",
    "train_simple_common[\"cases_lag_1_scaled\"] = scaler_simple.fit_transform(\n",
    "    train_simple_common[[\"cases_lag_1\"]]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "test_simple[\"cases_lag_1_scaled\"] = scaler_simple.transform(\n",
    "    test_simple[[\"cases_lag_1\"]]\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 94,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "features_simple_scaled = [\n",
    "    \"cases_lag_1_scaled\",\n",
    "    \"sin_week\",\n",
    "    \"cos_week\"\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 95,
   "metadata": {
    "scrolled": false
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "                     NegativeBinomial Regression Results                      \n",
