  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The quartile analysis confirmed regression-to-the-middle behaviour. Performance was strongest for moderate weeks. The models systematically overpredicted the lowest-burden quartile and underpredicted the highest-burden quartile. This is why a single overall MAE was not enough to judge operational usefulness.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 16. Exploratory high-burden early-warning classifier\n"
   ]
  },
